  "level": 1,
  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "A body starts falling freely from height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math> hits an inclined plane in its path at height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>. As a result of this perfectly elastic impact, the direction of the velocity of the body becomes horizontal. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac></math> for which the body will take the maximum time to reach the ground is _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f3d7a61f-7c4e-40a0-81b0-d41687cc4b37.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 181px;\"/></p><p>Total time of flight <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></math> can be written as, </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>For maximum time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msqrt><mi>H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>h</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
